# Local tooling scratch.
#
# scripts/*.sh used to be ignored with an allowlist of the real ones. Every new
# committed script then depended on someone remembering to add a negation, and
# three times they did not — most recently verify_test_discovery.sh, which CI
# invoked on a file that was never pushed ("No such file or directory", exit
# 127). A shell script referenced by a workflow is not scratch.
#
# Inverted: shell scripts are tracked by default and the genuinely local ones
# are named.
#
# That trade was originally described as swapping "CI calls a file that does not
# exist" for "committed a local helper — visible in review, harmless". Both
# halves of that were wrong (#738). `.sh` is exactly where credentials get
# typed: CLAUDE.md documents `FREEMIUS_BEARER_TOKEN=… bash
# scripts/release_freemius.sh`, so `export TOKEN=…` in a local helper is the
# expected shape. And "visible in review" does not hold for agent-authored
# commits — `git add -A` is routine, and is how .wrangler account state reached
# a published ZIP in 3.10.0/3.10.1. A leaked credential is not recoverable by
# reverting.
#
# The default stays, and both failure modes are now caught in CI instead of
# traded against each other:
#   scripts/verify_workflow_scripts.sh      — a workflow naming a file git does
#                                             not track fails the build
#   scripts/verify_no_committed_secrets.sh  — a tracked script carrying a
#                                             credential-shaped literal fails it
scripts/*.py
!scripts/verify_release_compatibility.py
!scripts/intake_triage.py
scripts/*.php
scripts/update-github-assets.sh
scripts/validate-workflows.sh

# Test caches
__pycache__/
mcpwp/tests/.phpunit.result.cache
.claude/
# but track the mumcp squad's agent definitions — they belong to the MCPWP tenant's repo
!.claude/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/*.md
mcp-server/*.mcpb
.claude/worktrees/
site-pilot-ai/

# graphify knowledge graph output (regenerated locally; hook rewrites graph.json per commit)
graphify-out/

# Wrangler local state — Cloudflare account id/name cache and local R2 blobs.
# mcpwp/.wrangler/cache/wrangler-account.json reached the published plugin ZIP
# on 3.10.0/3.10.1 via a repo-root "git add -A". Never distributable.
.wrangler/
